{"product_id":"asterix-and-the-laurel-wreath-album-18","title":"Asterix and the Laurel Wreath: Album #18","description":"\u003cp\u003eChief Vitalstatistix has rashly bet his brother-in-law, the infuriating show-off Homeopathix, that he can get hold of Caesar's laurel wreath to season a stew. Of course, now it's up to Asterix and Obelix to go to Rome, find the wreath, and bring it back for the promised dinner. Can they save Vitalstatistix's honor?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 216 x 286\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: René Goscinny | Albert Uderzo\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780752866376\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45867795447961,"sku":"17RC-1-9780752866376","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/91Ru1uqOwNL.jpg?v=1762508468","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/asterix-and-the-laurel-wreath-album-18","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}